{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00192","headline":"中和节赐羣臣宴赋七韵 · 德宗皇帝","name":"中和节赐羣臣宴赋七韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风变梅柳，万汇生春光。\n中和纪月令，方与天地长。\n耽乐岂予尚，懿兹时景良。\n庶遂亭育恩，同致寰海康。\n君臣永终始，交泰符阴阳。\n曲沼水新碧，华林桃稍芳。\n胜赏信多欢，戒之在无荒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}